  (text "CRITICAL SAFETY RULES & OWNER DECISIONS (docs/WIRING.md)\n1. [H3] NEVER connect J3 #1 (VCC_5V) to PC USB VBUS. Only D-/D+/GND go to J3.\n2. [HW_STATE] NEVER connect X630 10-pin #2 (HDET = 4.8V) to ESP32-P4 GPIO (3.3V max).\n3. [PLAN 4.4] ATX/KVM outputs & KVM LED inputs MUST use direct GPIO (NOT MCP23017).\n4. [PR #174] VBUS divider: R1=130k, R2=162k (0.5% E96); NO ESD diode on J3 (#4/#174).\n5. [PWR SEQ] Power ESP32-P4 via H2 Type-C BEFORE connecting target PC VBUS.\n6. [PROVISIONAL] P1 GPIOs 20..23,46 (ATX/KVM out) & 32,33,47,48 (KVM LED in) are\n   PROVISIONAL TODO(hw-verify) candidates from safe pool; finalize via Kconfig!" (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 20.32 222.25 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35) (color 120 10 10 1.0)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "d4e94a7e-e08b-5d85-ba0e-4c0901d6705c")
  )
  (rectangle (start 279.4 25.4) (end 403.86 147.32)
    (stroke (width 0.254) (type solid) (color 30 80 160 1.0)) (fill (type none))
    (uuid "3f5c328a-bf6f-5671-8add-54e864d4a034")
  )
  (text "PCB-FIXED INTERFACES ON ESP32-P4-ETH\n(Internal to Waveshare PCB — No external P1 wiring)\n\n- H2 Type-C UART: U4 CH343P -> GPIO37/38, +5V via AO3401/D2\n- J4 100M Ethernet: U10 IP101GRI -> GPIO28..31,34,35,49..52\n- TF1 microSD 4-bit: GPIO39..44, PMOS Q1 gate GPIO45 (+10k PD)\n    Pull-ups R8..R12 (51k) -> ESP_LDO_VO4 (3300 mV)\n- J1 MIPI-CSI 22-pin: CSI_CLK/D0/D1, R44/R46 2.2k I2C PU\n    (Detailed on Sheet 3: x630_csi.kicad_sch)\n- U9/U11 Audio (unused): I2S GPIO9..13, GPIO53 PA_CTRL,\n    I2C shared on GPIO7/8 (check ES8311 addr conflict G2)\n- Boot/Reset: Key1 BOOT=GPIO35, Key2 RESET=CHIP_PU (3.3V)\n- Strapping: GPIO34..38 (no external drive allowed)\n- Power Rails: MP1658GTF-Z ESP_3V3 (meas 3.34V),\n    LDO_VO3=2500mV (MIPI PHY), LDO_VO4=3300mV (SD PU)" (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 283.21 29.21 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3) (color 20 50 120 1.0)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "e82c5714-44b7-58a1-a931-c97a8b6a30dd")
  )
  (rectangle (start 279.4 157.48) (end 403.86 228.6)
    (stroke (width 0.254) (type solid) (color 80 40 140 1.0)) (fill (type none))
    (uuid "f7e75615-2869-5b42-a1d9-d644d0784c9f")
  )
  (text "SHEET DIRECTORY & GPIO BUDGET\n\nPage 1 (Root): P1 40-pin + J3 USB OTG + System Interconnect\nPage 2 (USB_VBUS): Target PC USB + R1/R2 0.5% E96 VBUS Sense\nPage 3 (X630_CSI): J1 22p <-> X630 15p CSI + X630 10p Ctrl\nPage 4 (I2C_OLED_PANEL): SSD1306 (0x3C/3D) + MCP23017 (0x20)\nPage 5 (ATX_KVM_CTRL): 74HC139 x2 + 12x Photorelay + 4x Opto\n\nRemaining P1 Safe Spare GPIOs (5 pins after provisional):\n  GPIO6, GPIO14, GPIO15, GPIO19, GPIO54 (+ JTAG GPIO2..5)" (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 283.21 161.29 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3) (color 60 30 110 1.0)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "f7b8a5b1-4266-5381-b8ce-ef94d57f5ea8")
  )
  (sheet_instances
    (path "/" (page "1"))
  )
